Usage: cs thymus [options] [command] [command options]
  Options:
    --access-token-file
      File used instead of reading the access tokens
	  from "~/.cs/access-tokens.json".
    --config-file
      Configuration file used instead of reading the default configuration
	  from "~/.cs/config".
    --debug
      Set log level to debug.
    --help
      Displays this help message.
  Commands:
    list-policies      Returns all policies available within the Carbyne Stack Virtual Cloud.
			This command will return the intersection of the policies registered
			across all the VCPs in the VC.
      Usage: list-policies [options]

    get-policy      Returns the policy with the given name.
			A Thymus policy name composed of a namespace and a name, e.g., 
			"default-policies:donor-read.rego", where "default-policies" is the
			namespace and "donor-read.rego" is the name.

			This command verifies that the policy is consistent across all the VCPs.
      Usage: get-policy [options] POLICY_ID


